<html class="djot-viewer"><head><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Math e^{i\pi}</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cstyle%3E%40media%20(prefers-color-scheme%3A%20dark)%20%7B%20rect%20%7B%20fill%3A%20%234493f8%3B%20%7D%20%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2232%22%20height%3D%2232%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%230969da%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2216%22%20y%3D%2222%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%2CHelvetica%2Csans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2221%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3Edj%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E"></head><body><nav class="toc" aria-label="Table of contents"><details><summary>Contents</summary><ul><li><a href="#Math-e-i-pi">Math <span class="math inline"><math><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow class="tml-sml-pad"><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msup></math></span></a><ul><li><a href="#Errors">Errors</a></li><li><a href="#No-math-here">No math here</a></li></ul></li></ul></details></nav><main class="djot"><section id="Math-e-i-pi">
<h1>Math <span class="math inline"><math><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow class="tml-sml-pad"><mi>i</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></msup></math></span></h1>
<p>Inline math: <span class="math inline"><math><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn class="tml-sml-pad">2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn class="tml-sml-pad">2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>z</mi><mn class="tml-sml-pad">2</mn></msup></mrow></math></span>.  Display math:</p>
<p><span class="math display"><math display="block" class="tml-display" style="display:block math;"><mrow><msubsup><mo movablelimits="false">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence="true" form="prefix" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo fence="true" form="postfix" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mspace width="0.1667em"></mspace><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math></span></p>
<section id="Errors">
<h2>Errors</h2>
<p>Invalid TeX: <span class="math inline"><span class="temml-error" style="color:#b22222;white-space:pre-line;">\frac{1}{

ParseError:  Unexpected end of input in a macro argument, expected '}' at end of input: \frac{1}{</span></span>.</p>
<p>A link that <code>trust: false</code> must disable: <span class="math inline"><math><mrow><mtext style="color:#b22222;">\href</mtext><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.2222em" rspace="0.2222em">:</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mo fence="true" form="prefix" stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence="true" form="postfix" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></math></span>.</p>
</section>
<section id="No-math-here">
<h2>No math here</h2>
